    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ग्रामीण क्षेत्र अनुसूचित जाति (SC)/अनुसूचित जनजाति (ST), women, and अल्पसंख्यक समुदाय entrepreneurs are पात्र for up to 35% capital सब्सिडी (अनुदान) with a 5% margin money contribution on विनिर्माण projects up to ₹50 लाख. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ब्याज ब्याज छूट.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ग्रामीण क्षेत्र अनुसूचित जाति (SC)/अनुसूचित जनजाति (ST), women, and अल्पसंख्यक समुदाय entrepreneurs are पात्र for up to 35% capital सब्सिडी (अनुदान) with a 5% margin money contribution on विनिर्माण projects up to ₹50 लाख. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ब्याज ब्याज छूट.",
