    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, గ్రామీణ షెడ్యూల్డ్ కులం (SC)/షెడ్యూల్డ్ తెగ (ST), women, and మైనారిటీ సంఘం entrepreneurs are అర్హతగల for up to 35% capital సబ్సిడీ (రాయితీ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ఉత్పాదక projects up to ₹50 లక్ష. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% వడ్డీ వడ్డీ రాయితీ.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, గ్రామీణ షెడ్యూల్డ్ కులం (SC)/షెడ్యూల్డ్ తెగ (ST), women, and మైనారిటీ సంఘం entrepreneurs are అర్హతగల for up to 35% capital సబ్సిడీ (రాయితీ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ఉత్పాదక projects up to ₹50 లక్ష. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% వడ్డీ వడ్డీ రాయితీ.",
