    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ (SC)/ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡ (ST), women, and ಅಲ್ಪಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ ಸಮುದಾಯ entrepreneurs are ಅರ್ಹ for up to 35% capital ಸಬ್ಸಿಡಿ (ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆ projects up to ₹50 ಲಕ್ಷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ಬಡ್ಡಿ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ (SC)/ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡ (ST), women, and ಅಲ್ಪಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ ಸಮುದಾಯ entrepreneurs are ಅರ್ಹ for up to 35% capital ಸಬ್ಸಿಡಿ (ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆ projects up to ₹50 ಲಕ್ಷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ಬಡ್ಡಿ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ.",
