    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ഗ്രാമീണ പട്ടികജാതി (SC)/പട്ടികവർഗ്ഗം (ST), women, and ന്യൂനപക്ഷ വിഭാഗം entrepreneurs are അർഹതയുള്ള for up to 35% capital സബ്‌സിഡി with a 5% margin money contribution on ഉൽപ്പാദനം projects up to ₹50 ലക്ഷം. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% പലിശ പലിശ ഇളവ്.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ഗ്രാമീണ പട്ടികജാതി (SC)/പട്ടികവർഗ്ഗം (ST), women, and ന്യൂനപക്ഷ വിഭാഗം entrepreneurs are അർഹതയുള്ള for up to 35% capital സബ്‌സിഡി with a 5% margin money contribution on ഉൽപ്പാദനം projects up to ₹50 ലക്ഷം. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% പലിശ പലിശ ഇളവ്.",
