    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ग्रामीण अनुसूचित जाती (SC)/अनुसूचित जमाती (ST), women, and अल्पसंख्याक समुदाय entrepreneurs are पात्र for up to 35% capital अनुदान with a 5% margin money contribution on उत्पादन projects up to ₹50 लाख. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% व्याज व्याज सवलत.",
