    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ગ્રામીણ અનુસૂચિત જાતિ (SC)/અનુસૂચિત જનજાતિ (ST), women, and લઘુમતી સમુદાય entrepreneurs are પાત્ર for up to 35% capital સબસિડી with a 5% margin money contribution on ઉત્પાદન projects up to ₹50 લાખ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% વ્યાજ વ્યાજ રાહત.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ગ્રામીણ અનુસૂચિત જાતિ (SC)/અનુસૂચિત જનજાતિ (ST), women, and લઘુમતી સમુદાય entrepreneurs are પાત્ર for up to 35% capital સબસિડી with a 5% margin money contribution on ઉત્પાદન projects up to ₹50 લાખ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% વ્યાજ વ્યાજ રાહત.",
