    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ਪੇਂਡੂ ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਾਤੀ (SC)/ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਨਜਾਤੀ (ST), women, and ਘੱਟ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਭਾਈਚਾਰਾ entrepreneurs are ਯੋਗ for up to 35% capital ਸਬਸਿਡੀ with a 5% margin money contribution on ਨਿਰਮਾਣ projects up to ₹50 ਲੱਖ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ਵਿਆਜ ਵਿਆਜ ਛੋਟ.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ਪੇਂਡੂ ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਾਤੀ (SC)/ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਨਜਾਤੀ (ST), women, and ਘੱਟ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਭਾਈਚਾਰਾ entrepreneurs are ਯੋਗ for up to 35% capital ਸਬਸਿਡੀ with a 5% margin money contribution on ਨਿਰਮਾਣ projects up to ₹50 ਲੱਖ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ਵਿਆਜ ਵਿਆਜ ਛੋਟ.",
