    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ଗ୍ରାମାଞ୍ଚଳ ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜାତି (SC)/ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜନଜାତି (ST), women, and ସଂଖ୍ୟାଲଘୁ ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ entrepreneurs are ଯୋଗ୍ୟ for up to 35% capital ରିହାତି / ସବସିଡି with a 5% margin money contribution on ଉତ୍ପାଦନ projects up to ₹50 ଲକ୍ଷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ସୁଧ ସୁଧ ରିହାତି.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, ଗ୍ରାମାଞ୍ଚଳ ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜାତି (SC)/ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜନଜାତି (ST), women, and ସଂଖ୍ୟାଲଘୁ ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ entrepreneurs are ଯୋଗ୍ୟ for up to 35% capital ରିହାତି / ସବସିଡି with a 5% margin money contribution on ଉତ୍ପାଦନ projects up to ₹50 ଲକ୍ଷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ସୁଧ ସୁଧ ରିହାତି.",
