    "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, গ্ৰাম্য অনুসূচিত জাতি (SC)/অনুসূচিত জনজাতি (ST), women, and সংখ্যালঘু সম্প্ৰদায় entrepreneurs are যোগ্য for up to 35% capital ৰেহাই / ৰাজসাহায্য with a 5% margin money contribution on উৎপাদন projects up to ₹50 লাখ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% সুদ সুদ ৰেহাই.",
    "under pmegp, rural sc/st, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 lakh. for street vendors, pm svanidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": "Under PMEGP, গ্ৰাম্য অনুসূচিত জাতি (SC)/অনুসূচিত জনজাতি (ST), women, and সংখ্যালঘু সম্প্ৰদায় entrepreneurs are যোগ্য for up to 35% capital ৰেহাই / ৰাজসাহায্য with a 5% margin money contribution on উৎপাদন projects up to ₹50 লাখ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% সুদ সুদ ৰেহাই.",
