  "All Indian identity parameters (Aadhaar 12-digit number, PAN identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.": {
    "en": "All Indian identity parameters (Aadhaar 12-digit number, PAN identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "hi": "सभी Indian identity parameters (आधार कार्ड 12-digit number, पैन कार्ड identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "ta": "அனைத்து Indian identity parameters (ஆதார் அட்டை 12-digit number, பான் கார்டு identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "te": "అన్ని Indian identity parameters (ఆధార్ కార్డు 12-digit number, పాన్ కార్డు identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "kn": "ಎಲ್ಲಾ Indian identity parameters (ಆಧಾರ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್ 12-digit number, ಪ್ಯಾನ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್ identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "ml": "എല്ലാ Indian identity parameters (ആധാർ കാർഡ് 12-digit number, പാൻ കാർഡ് identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "mr": "सर्व Indian identity parameters (आधार कार्ड 12-digit number, पॅन कार्ड identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "bn": "সকল Indian identity parameters (আধার কার্ড 12-digit number, প্যান কার্ড identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "gu": "બધા Indian identity parameters (આધાર કાર્ડ 12-digit number, પાન કાર્ડ identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "pa": "ਸਾਰੇ Indian identity parameters (ਆਧਾਰ ਕਾਰਡ 12-digit number, ਪੈਨ ਕਾਰਡ identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "or": "ସମସ୍ତ Indian identity parameters (ଆଧାର କାର୍ଡ 12-digit number, ପାନ କାର୍ଡ identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk.",
    "as": "সকলো Indian identity parameters (আধাৰ কাৰ্ড 12-digit number, পেন কাৰ্ড identifier) are cryptographically hashed via SHA-256 and masked before persistence. No raw PII was stored on disk."
  },
