  "Real-time milestone transparency for AI document verification, bank branch invitations, credit appraisal, and government margin subsidy release.": {
    "en": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI document verification, bank branch invitations, credit appraisal, and government margin subsidy release.",
    "hi": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI दस्तावेज़ सत्यापन, बैंक शाखा invitations, credit appraisal, and सरकारी margin सब्सिडी (अनुदान) release.",
    "ta": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI ஆவணம் சரிபார்ப்பு, வங்கி கிளை invitations, credit appraisal, and அரசு margin மானிய உதவி release.",
    "te": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI పత్రం ధృవీకరణ, బ్యాంక్ శాఖ invitations, credit appraisal, and ప్రభుత్వ margin సబ్సిడీ (రాయితీ) release.",
    "kn": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI ದಾಖಲೆ ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ, ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಶಾಖೆ invitations, credit appraisal, and ಸರ್ಕಾರಿ margin ಸಬ್ಸಿಡಿ (ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ) release.",
    "ml": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI രേഖ പരിശോധന, ബാങ്ക് ശാഖ invitations, credit appraisal, and സർക്കാർ margin സബ്‌സിഡി release.",
    "mr": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI कागदपत्र पडताळणी, बँक शाखा invitations, credit appraisal, and शासकीय margin अनुदान release.",
    "bn": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI নথি যাচাইকরণ, ব্যাংক শাখা invitations, credit appraisal, and সরকারি margin ভর্তুকি release.",
    "gu": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI દસ્તાવેજ ચકાસણી, બેંક શાખા invitations, credit appraisal, and સરકારી margin સબસિડી release.",
    "pa": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI ਦਸਤਾਵੇਜ਼ ਤਸਦੀਕ, ਬੈਂਕ ਬ੍ਰਾਂਚ invitations, credit appraisal, and ਸਰਕਾਰੀ margin ਸਬਸਿਡੀ release.",
    "or": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI ଦସ୍ତାବିଜ ଯାଞ୍ଚ, ବ୍ୟାଙ୍କ ଶାଖା invitations, credit appraisal, and ସରକାରୀ margin ରିହାତି / ସବସିଡି release.",
    "as": "Real-time milestone transparency for AI নথি পৰীক্ষণ, বেংক শাখা invitations, credit appraisal, and চৰকাৰী margin ৰেহাই / ৰাজসাহায্য release."
  },
