  "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.": {
    "en": "Under PMEGP, rural SC/ST, women, and minority entrepreneurs are eligible for up to 35% capital subsidy with a 5% margin money contribution on manufacturing projects up to ₹50 Lakh. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% interest subvention.",
    "hi": "Under PMEGP, ग्रामीण क्षेत्र अनुसूचित जाति (SC)/अनुसूचित जनजाति (ST), women, and अल्पसंख्यक समुदाय entrepreneurs are पात्र for up to 35% capital सब्सिडी (अनुदान) with a 5% margin money contribution on विनिर्माण projects up to ₹50 लाख. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ब्याज ब्याज छूट.",
    "ta": "Under PMEGP, கிராமப்புறம் பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட சாதி (SC)/பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட பழங்குடி (ST), women, and சிறுபான்மையினர் சமூகம் entrepreneurs are தகுதியான for up to 35% capital மானிய உதவி with a 5% margin money contribution on உற்பத்தி projects up to ₹50 லட்சம். For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% வட்டி வட்டி மானியம்.",
    "te": "Under PMEGP, గ్రామీణ షెడ్యూల్డ్ కులం (SC)/షెడ్యూల్డ్ తెగ (ST), women, and మైనారిటీ సంఘం entrepreneurs are అర్హతగల for up to 35% capital సబ్సిడీ (రాయితీ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ఉత్పాదక projects up to ₹50 లక్ష. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% వడ్డీ వడ్డీ రాయితీ.",
    "kn": "Under PMEGP, ಗ್ರಾಮೀಣ ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಜಾತಿ (SC)/ಪರಿಶಿಷ್ಟ ಪಂಗಡ (ST), women, and ಅಲ್ಪಸಂಖ್ಯಾತ ಸಮುದಾಯ entrepreneurs are ಅರ್ಹ for up to 35% capital ಸಬ್ಸಿಡಿ (ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ) with a 5% margin money contribution on ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆ projects up to ₹50 ಲಕ್ಷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ಬಡ್ಡಿ ಬಡ್ಡಿ ರಿಯಾಯಿತಿ.",
    "ml": "Under PMEGP, ഗ്രാമീണ പട്ടികജാതി (SC)/പട്ടികവർഗ്ഗം (ST), women, and ന്യൂനപക്ഷ വിഭാഗം entrepreneurs are അർഹതയുള്ള for up to 35% capital സബ്‌സിഡി with a 5% margin money contribution on ഉൽപ്പാദനം projects up to ₹50 ലക്ഷം. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% പലിശ പലിശ ഇളവ്.",
    "mr": "Under PMEGP, ग्रामीण अनुसूचित जाती (SC)/अनुसूचित जमाती (ST), women, and अल्पसंख्याक समुदाय entrepreneurs are पात्र for up to 35% capital अनुदान with a 5% margin money contribution on उत्पादन projects up to ₹50 लाख. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% व्याज व्याज सवलत.",
    "bn": "Under PMEGP, গ্রামীণ তফসিলি জাতি (SC)/তফসিলি উপজাতি (ST), women, and সংখ্যালঘু সম্প্রদায় entrepreneurs are যোগ্য for up to 35% capital ভর্তুকি with a 5% margin money contribution on উৎপাদন projects up to ₹50 লাখ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% সুদ সুদ ছাড়.",
    "gu": "Under PMEGP, ગ્રામીણ અનુસૂચિત જાતિ (SC)/અનુસૂચિત જનજાતિ (ST), women, and લઘુમતી સમુદાય entrepreneurs are પાત્ર for up to 35% capital સબસિડી with a 5% margin money contribution on ઉત્પાદન projects up to ₹50 લાખ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% વ્યાજ વ્યાજ રાહત.",
    "pa": "Under PMEGP, ਪੇਂਡੂ ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਾਤੀ (SC)/ਅਨੁਸੂਚਿਤ ਜਨਜਾਤੀ (ST), women, and ਘੱਟ ਗਿਣਤੀ ਭਾਈਚਾਰਾ entrepreneurs are ਯੋਗ for up to 35% capital ਸਬਸਿਡੀ with a 5% margin money contribution on ਨਿਰਮਾਣ projects up to ₹50 ਲੱਖ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ਵਿਆਜ ਵਿਆਜ ਛੋਟ.",
    "or": "Under PMEGP, ଗ୍ରାମାଞ୍ଚଳ ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜାତି (SC)/ଅନୁସୂଚିତ ଜନଜାତି (ST), women, and ସଂଖ୍ୟାଲଘୁ ସମ୍ପ୍ରଦାୟ entrepreneurs are ଯୋଗ୍ୟ for up to 35% capital ରିହାତି / ସବସିଡି with a 5% margin money contribution on ଉତ୍ପାଦନ projects up to ₹50 ଲକ୍ଷ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% ସୁଧ ସୁଧ ରିହାତି.",
    "as": "Under PMEGP, গ্ৰাম্য অনুসূচিত জাতি (SC)/অনুসূচিত জনজাতি (ST), women, and সংখ্যালঘু সম্প্ৰদায় entrepreneurs are যোগ্য for up to 35% capital ৰেহাই / ৰাজসাহায্য with a 5% margin money contribution on উৎপাদন projects up to ₹50 লাখ. For street vendors, PM SVANidhi provides up to ₹50,000 micro-credit with a 7% সুদ সুদ ৰেহাই."
  },
